//investor.com.tw/onlineNews/NewsContent.asp?articleNo=14202602260099", "domain": "investor.com.tw", "site": "財訊快報", "title": "OpenAI挖角Meta AI主將龐若鳴，亞馬遜500億美元投資細節浮出水面", "desc": "【財訊快報／陳孟朔】根據科技媒體《信息報》(The Information)最新報導，AI 領域人才爭奪戰持續升級，OpenAI近期成功聘請Meta頂尖AI研究員龐若鳴(Ruoming Pang)。龐若鳴先前在蘋果公司(Apple)擔任基礎模型團隊(AFM)負責人，領導約100名工程師推進Apple Intelligence的核心模型開發，隨後於2025年以天價薪酬被Meta挖角至其「超級智慧實驗室」。此次龐若鳴轉投OpenAI，被視為OpenAI在多模態大模型與邊緣運算領域戰力進一步強化的訊號。"}}, {"id": 70053, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T09:33:58+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "17:33", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": ["#營邦", "#輝達"], "text": "#營邦 #輝達\n\nhttps://www.investor.com.tw/onlineNews/NewsContent.asp?articleNo=14202602260080", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70053", "preview": null}, {"id": 70054, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T09:34:49+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "17:34", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": ["#甲骨文"], "text": "#甲骨文\n\nhttps://www.investor.com.tw/onlineNews/NewsContent.asp?articleNo=14202602260051", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70054", "preview": null}, {"id": 70055, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T09:36:15+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "17:36", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": ["#能源"], "text": "#能源 \n\nhttps://www.investor.com.tw/onlineNews/NewsContent.asp?articleNo=14202602260023", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70055", "preview": null}, {"id": 70056, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T09:36:47+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "17:36", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": ["#緯穎"], "text": "#緯穎\n\nhttps://www.investor.com.tw/MobileHttps/content.asp?articleNo=14202602260150", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70056", "preview": {"url": "https://investor.com.tw/MobileHttps/content.asp?articleNo=14202602260150", "domain": "investor.com.tw", "site": "財訊快報", "title": "緯穎去年每股大賺275.06元，年增逾倍，AI產品佔比過半", "desc": "【財訊快報／記者王宜弘報導】AI伺服器大廠緯穎<span onclick=showCommodity('','6669','','','','') style=cursor:hand;color:#0000FF>( 6669 )</span>週四(26日)召開董事會，通過去年財報，全年合併營收達9,506.63億元，年增率達163.7%，其中AI產品占比已過半。"}}, {"id": 70057, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T09:37:06+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "17:37", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": ["#研華", "#IPC"], "text": "#研華 #IPC\n\nhttps://www.investor.com.tw/onlineNews/NewsContent.asp?articleNo=14202602260140", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70057", "preview": {"url": "https://investor.com.tw/onlineNews/NewsContent.asp?articleNo=14202602260140", "domain": "investor.com.tw", "site": "財訊快報", "title": "研華去年EPS 12.25元，Q4 BB Ratio達1.33，歐美中需求強勁，今年看旺", "desc": "【財訊快報／記者王宜弘報導】IPC龍頭研華<span onclick=showCommodity('','2395','','','','') style=cursor:hand;color:#0000FF>( 2395 )</span>公告去年財報，全年合併營收達708.82億元，年增19%，毛利率39.8%，稅後淨利105.93億元，年增18%，EPS 12.25元。"}}, {"id": 70058, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T09:38:07+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "17:38", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": ["#安碁資訊", "#資安"], "text": "#安碁資訊 #資安\n\nhttps://www.investor.com.tw/onlineNews/NewsContent.asp?articleNo=14202602260092", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70058", "preview": {"url": "https://investor.com.tw/onlineNews/NewsContent.asp?articleNo=14202602260092", "domain": "investor.com.tw", "site": "財訊快報", "title": "資安需求不墜，安碁資訊去年獲利創高，EPS 10.22元，擬配息9元", "desc": "【財訊快報／記者陳浩寧報導】安碁資訊<span onclick=showCommodity('','6690','','','','') style=cursor:hand;color:#0000FF>( 6690 )</span>去年全年營收、獲利雙創歷史新高，全年營收24.32億元，營業淨利3.64億元，稅後純益3.07億元，EPS 10.22元，獲利超過一個股本，董事會通過擬配發每股現金股利9.0元，配發率近九成，以今日開盤價159元計算，殖利率逾5.6%，股東會預計將在5月27日舉行。"}}, {"id": 70059, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T09:38:36+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "17:38", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": ["#智易", "#網通"], "text": "#智易 #網通\n\nhttps://www.investor.com.tw/onlineNews/NewsContent.asp?articleNo=14202602260047", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70059", "preview": {"url": "https://investor.com.tw/onlineNews/NewsContent.asp?articleNo=14202602260047", "domain": "investor.com.tw", "site": "財訊快報", "title": "智易去年三率三升，EPS 12.6元連八年創高，每股擬配息9元", "desc": "【財訊快報／記者劉居全報導】智易科技<span onclick=showCommodity('','3596','','','','') style=cursor:hand;color:#0000FF>( 3596 )</span>公布去年第四季營收130.03億元，年增7.6%，第四季營業毛利為19.88億元，毛利率15.3%，年減0.1個百分點；營業淨利為8.21億元，營業淨利率6.3%，年增0.1個百分點，營業外收入7000萬元，稅後淨利為6.8億元，淨利率5.2%。每股盈餘(EPS)3.08元。"}}, {"id": 70060, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T09:39:14+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "17:39", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": ["#穎崴"], "text": "#穎崴 ❤️\n\nhttps://www.investor.com.tw/onlineNews/NewsContent.asp?articleNo=14202602260045", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70060", "preview": {"url": "https://investor.com.tw/onlineNews/NewsContent.asp?articleNo=14202602260045", "domain": "investor.com.tw", "site": "財訊快報", "title": "穎崴去年EPS 46.93元，擬配息50元，AI、HPC趨勢擴大，估今年營運續佳", "desc": "【財訊快報／記者李純君報導】半導體測試基座龍頭穎崴科技<span onclick=showCommodity('','6515','','','','') style=cursor:hand;color:#0000FF>( 6515 )</span>AI趨勢下，公司2025年營收及獲利皆創歷史新高，全年每股淨利46.93元，而公司擬配發現金股利每股50元，包含資本公積。展望2026年因AI與HPC趨勢擴大，今年穎崴營收和獲利，都會比去年更好。"}}, {"id": 70061, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T09:40:01+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "17:40", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": ["#臺慶科", "#被動元件"], "text": "#臺慶科 #被動元件\n\nhttps://www.investor.com.tw/onlineNews/NewsContent.asp?articleNo=14202602260113", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70061", "preview": {"url": "https://investor.com.tw/onlineNews/NewsContent.asp?articleNo=14202602260113", "domain": "investor.com.tw", "site": "財訊快報", "title": "焦點股：卡位電感漲價紅利，臺慶科股價沿五日線墊高", "desc": "【財訊快報／研究員周佳蓉】臺慶科<span onclick=showCommodity('','3357','','','','') style=cursor:hand;color:#0000FF>( 3357 )</span>受惠於全球被動元件漲價潮及AI伺服器規格革命，營運進入爆發期。電感龍頭村田製作所與TDK已針對旗下積層電感及磁珠產品調漲價格，加上被動元件陸資廠風華高科、深圳順絡等多家公司去年已啟動調漲，與台廠價差收斂之下，急單、轉單成為2026年一開年的關注焦點。電感主要用途為過濾電流雜訊、防止電磁波干擾，隨著AI晶片功耗大幅躍升，伺服器電源模組對高性能TLVR電感需求激增，公司除了…"}}, {"id": 70062, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T09:50:43+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "17:50", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": ["#盤點"], "text": "✅2026/02/26 #盤點\n牧羊人趕羊大勝D4\n\n🔸交易帳1》 史高\n🔸交易帳2》 史高\n🔸投資帳》 次高\n\n‼️空單保險 災害預備\n\n抖金 DoD  +3.46%\n\n華麗電力城；奇幻魔力鋐\n創高有新意；円滿超新星\n\n開紅法人勝 ；趁勢插針險\n你丟我也丟；你撿我也撿 （2/23）\n\n連莊紅瘋勝；交易有甜甜\n你空我就嘎；你多我就拖（2/24）\n\n連二拉二紅；深V好性感\n耐不住安靜；迎不了高峰（2/25）\n\n又逢和平假；再遇大調節\n明星仍閃耀；決戰三月十（2/26）", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70062", "preview": null}, {"id": 70063, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T09:51:43+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "17:51", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": [], "text": "✅越寫越多天餒…… \n就到這禮拜而已啦……", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70063", "preview": null}, {"id": 70065, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T14:40:49+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "22:40", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": ["#Ai整理"], "text": "下半場\n\n#Ai整理 from NotebookLM", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70065", "preview": null}, {"id": 70067, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T14:46:40+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "22:46", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": [], "text": "還未聽 先放上來", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70067", "preview": null}, {"id": 70072, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T14:54:09+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "22:54", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": ["#盤勢"], "text": "#盤勢 別哎！省點力氣", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70072", "preview": null}, {"id": 70073, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T14:58:14+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "22:58", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": [], "text": "✅美國人也流行 賣在實現 ？？？", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70073", "preview": null}, {"id": 70075, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T15:28:39+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "23:28", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": ["#盤勢"], "text": "#盤勢 \n\n笑死 才去洗個澡…….\n\n門外 就叫我『洗洗洗！不要再洗了！』\n已經跌700點了\n趕快出來！\n給我鎮住！😑😑😑😑😑\n\n肩頭都緊了起來😮‍💨", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70075", "preview": null}, {"id": 70076, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T15:30:11+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "23:30", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": ["#群聯"], "text": "#群聯 這是跟法人槓上了嗎🤣\n\nhttps://x.com/qq_timmy/status/2026949469452034336?s=46&t=vNuB7YZ8yNewPS2shuEudQ", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70076", "preview": {"url": "https://x.com/qq_timmy/status/2026949469452034336?s=46&t=vNuB7YZ8yNewPS2shuEudQ", "domain": "x.com", "site": "X (formerly Twitter)", "title": "駿HaYaO (@QQ_Timmy) on X", "desc": "轉\n群聯電子股份有限公司\nPhison Electronics Corporation\n日期： 2026年2月23日\n主旨： 溫馨通知 - 付款條件更新\n親愛的尊貴客戶：\n我們衷心感謝您長期的支持與合作。由於AI基礎設施的快速發展，帶來NAND需求的顯著大幅增長，我們的主要供應商近期已調整其付款要求，改為預付款或縮短付款期限。"}}, {"id": 70077, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T15:33:35+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "23:33", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": [], "text": "精神分裂！！！！！ 美國人很會做股票嘛～～～～", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70077", "preview": null}, {"id": 70078, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T15:33:35+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "23:33", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": [], "text": "英偉達業績未能消除AI擔憂，美股開盤走低\n\n美國股市開盤時出現下跌，英偉達業績雖好於預期，但未能消除投資者對人工智能帶來的顛覆性風險以及大型科技公司盈利增長可持續性的擔憂。標普500指數中權重最大的英偉達的股價下跌超3%。“今年屬於週期性的牛市，資金已不再侷限於大型市值股票，而是向其他領域擴展。因此，投資者必須積極調整資金配置，以適應市場板塊趨勢的不斷變化。”派珀桑德勒公司的首席市場技術分析師克雷格·約翰遜在一份報吿中寫道。另外，隨着英偉達增加其供應方面的相關承諾，內存和存儲類股票價格隨之上漲。閃迪公司股價上漲了 2%。", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70078", "preview": null}, {"id": 70079, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T15:35:46+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "23:35", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": [], "text": "市場還是寧願聽從 專業 的法人機構建議", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70079", "preview": null}, {"id": 70080, "date_utc": "2026-02-26T15:40:33+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-26", "local_time": "23:40", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": [], "text": "😑😑😑😑😑😑😑😑😑😑😑\n三小！！！😮‍💨", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70080", "preview": null}, {"id": 70081, "date_utc": "2026-02-27T06:30:19+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-27", "local_time": "14:30", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": ["#群聯"], "text": "#群聯 …………….", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70081", "preview": null}, {"id": 70083, "date_utc": "2026-02-27T14:40:48+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-27", "local_time": "22:40", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": ["#DELL", "#矽光子"], "text": "績優股走高，#DELL 漲17%，業績、指引均超預期，預計AI服務器收入將翻倍； \n#矽光子 光通訊概念股Applied Optoelectronics漲超34%，一季度業績指引超預期。\nhttps://news.futunn.com/flash/19996691?futusource=news_push_page&src=1&skintype=3&main_broker=WwogIDEwMDgKXQ%3D%3D&level=1&global_content=%7B%22promote_content%22%3A%22nn%3Aflash%3A19996691%22%2C%22invite%22%3A30400632%7D&data_ticket=f76817e14b8e3a31c6082497773d30fc&utm_medium=futu_niuniu_share&utm_content=web_share&utm_campaign=news&utm_term=19996691", "link": "https://t.me/c/1700405382/70083", "preview": {"url": "https://news.futunn.com/flash/19996691?data_ticket=f76817e14b8e3a31c6082497773d30fc&futusource=news_push_page&global_content=%7B%22promote_content%22%3A%22nn%3Aflash%3A19996691%22%2C%22invite%22%3A30400632%7D&level=1&main_broker=WwogIDEwMDgKXQ%3D%3D&skintype=3&src=1", "domain": "news.futunn.com", "site": "Futunn", "title": "绩优股走高， $戴尔科技(DELL.US)$ 涨17%，业绩、指引均超预期，预计AI服务器", "desc": "绩优股走高，$戴尔科技(DELL.US)$ 涨17%，业绩、指引均超预期，预计AI服务器收入将翻倍；光通讯概念股 $Applied Optoelectronics(AAOI.US)$ 涨超34%，一季度业绩指引超预期。"}}, {"id": 70084, "date_utc": "2026-02-27T14:42:28+00:00", "local_date": "2026-02-27", "local_time": "22:42", "iso_week": "2026-W09", "week_range": "2/23–3/1", "hashtags": ["#OpenAI", "#亞馬遜"], "text": "#OpenAI 與 #亞馬遜 宣佈戰略合作伙伴關係，後者追加1000億美元、爲期8年合作\nhttps://news.futunn.com/t/flash/19996334/jNmVZBIvaa", "link": "https://t.me/c/1